  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable rural recovery-UNDP-SYR-00129824</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to restore the rural economy by promoting and developing sustainable livelihoods in rural areas. It focuses on diversifying the rural economy and building local capacities, emphasizing sustainable practices to enhance resilience to environmental challenges. The project also seeks to empower local communities by developing infrastructure, improving market linkages, and providing effective support for projects that add value to local products.</narrative>
  </description>
